        <mxCell id="be_authnote" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#188038;dashed=1;align=left;spacingLeft=10;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0d652d;" value="&lt;b&gt;Auth rule.&lt;/b&gt;  Every endpoint except /register and /login requires an Authorization: Bearer header.&lt;br&gt;The API reads &lt;b&gt;user_id&lt;/b&gt; out of the token and scopes every query with &lt;b&gt;WHERE user_id = ?&lt;/b&gt;, so a user only ever sees their own data." vertex="1">
